{"1906740": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Spikeball Smash", "steam_appid": 1906740, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spikeball Smash brings the party to your room. Tap into the real-life energy of Spikeball solo or with up to four players. Feel the sand between your toes as you serve from the beach or listen to the cheers from the party as you dominate in the quad. Play to win with authentic Spikeball rules.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive for a last-second save, get back to the net for the setup, and crush the winning smash. The competition is fierce, but the controls are simple. Easy to learn, deep enough to master. Play it casual with friends or climb in ranked play. There’s no wrong way to approach Spikeball Smash.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906740/extras/34079e7b7442453535c0eabccc4ec369.poster.avif?t=1763723111\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906740/extras/34079e7b7442453535c0eabccc4ec369.webm?t=1763723111\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906740/extras/34079e7b7442453535c0eabccc4ec369.mp4?t=1763723111\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only licensed Spikeball video game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local and online multiplayer for 2-4 player</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ranked and casual play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customizable characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple arenas</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cross play with consoles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play for fun. Play for bragging rights. <strong>Play loud.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906740/extras/fd6ae93a317a3b624f4d507b61c85ea6.avif?t=1763723111\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906740/extras_big/fd6ae93a317a3b624f4d507b61c85ea6.webp?t=1763723111 width=1560 height=599 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spikeball Smash brings the party to your room. Tap into the real-life energy of Spikeball solo or with up to four players. Feel the sand between your toes as you serve from the beach or listen to the cheers from the party as you dominate in the quad. Play to win with authentic Spikeball rules.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive for a last-second save, get back to the net for the setup, and crush the winning smash. The competition is fierce, but the controls are simple. Easy to learn, deep enough to master. Play it casual with friends or climb in ranked play. There’s no wrong way to approach Spikeball Smash.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906740/extras/34079e7b7442453535c0eabccc4ec369.poster.avif?t=1763723111\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906740/extras/34079e7b7442453535c0eabccc4ec369.webm?t=1763723111\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906740/extras/34079e7b7442453535c0eabccc4ec369.mp4?t=1763723111\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only licensed Spikeball video game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local and online multiplayer for 2-4 player</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ranked and casual play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customizable characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple arenas</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cross play with consoles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play for fun. Play for bragging rights. <strong>Play loud.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906740/extras/fd6ae93a317a3b624f4d507b61c85ea6.avif?t=1763723111\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906740/extras_big/fd6ae93a317a3b624f4d507b61c85ea6.webp?t=1763723111 width=1560 height=599 /></span></p>", "short_description": "Play loud. Spikeball Smash is a 1–4 player online party sport. Smash, dive, and spike your way to victory on the beach, the quad, or the arena in fast-paced matches. Perfect for friends, built for parties, and ready to pick up and play even if you’re going solo.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906740/8f4ee9de9d772c6d4ee877920861b219cc127d3b/header.jpg?t=1763723111", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906740/66dcfa502670cb35bbda64a3d32410598e192c70/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763723111", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906740/66dcfa502670cb35bbda64a3d32410598e192c70/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763723111", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64 Bits<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-7590 / AMD Ryzen 5 23600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graph